	Improved KLIC with Optimized Goal Scheduling Ver.1.10
	    Kazuhiko Ohno and Masahiko Ikawa (Kyoto Univ.)

	  Copyright (C) 1996 Kazuhiko Ohno, Masahiko Ikawa,
